{
    "title": "Wolf Game: Wild Animal Wars",
    "description": "Team up with wolves from all over the world to fight with other wolf packs - to survive, explore, hunt, challenge, and revenge. As the Alpha of your packs, you will lead your wolves to defend your den and rise to the top of the food chain in the wild!\r\n\r\n**Features**\r\n\r\nAssemble a Mighty Wolfpack\r\nGather a diverse pack of wolves, including the powerful Timber Wolf, majestic Gray Wolf, elegant Arctic Wolf, and mysterious Black Wolf.\r\n\r\nLead Your Wolfpack\r\nControl your wolf pack and use real-time strategy to defend your den and attack your enemies. Navigate the wild map with its varied terrain to reach your target.\r\n\r\nJoin a Wolf Clan Alliance\r\nTeam up with like-minded players in an Alliance to expand your territory and conquer the world of wolves together. Participate in PVP battles against other packs to become the ruler of the wild.\r\n\r\nCross-server gameplay \r\nWhere players from different servers can play together and compete with each other in the same virtual environment. This adds a new level of excitement and challenge to the game as Wolf kings can interact with a wider range of opponents, forming alliances and engaging in battles on a massive scale. With cross-server feature, The Alphas have the opportunity to truly test their skills and see how they stack up against players from all over the world.\r\n\r\nExplore the Wilderness\r\nSend out scouts, explore the wild world , discover border invasions, spot traces of prey, avoid hunters' tracking. So the Alpha and pack can survive the wilderness.\r\n\r\nBuild a Wolf Kingdom\r\nStrategize to win battles and conquer the wild world, creating a wolf empire and becoming the Alpha of the pack.\r\n\r\nSeamless World Map\r\nAll in-game actions occur on a single big map inhabited by players and NPCs, with no isolated bases or separate battle screens. The \u201cinfinite zoom\u201d on mobile allows you to go through the world map and individual bases freely. Map features include natural obstructions such as rivers, mountains, and strategic passes that must be captured to gain access to adjacent areas.\r\n\r\n\r\nAttention: Wolf Game is a free-to-play strategy game themed on animals, while it offers in-app purchases for some in-game items and functions.\r\n\r\nA network connection is required to play this game.\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/wolfgameEN\r\nYoutube:https://www.youtube.com/@wolfgame__offical\r\nDiscord\uff1ahttps://discord.com/invite/CNq8BRcqmB",
    "descriptionHTML": "Team up with wolves from all over the world to fight with other wolf packs - to survive, explore, hunt, challenge, and revenge. As the Alpha of your packs, you will lead your wolves to defend your den and rise to the top of the food chain in the wild!<br><br>**Features**<br><br>Assemble a Mighty Wolfpack<br>Gather a diverse pack of wolves, including the powerful Timber Wolf, majestic Gray Wolf, elegant Arctic Wolf, and mysterious Black Wolf.<br><br>Lead Your Wolfpack<br>Control your wolf pack and use real-time strategy to defend your den and attack your enemies. Navigate the wild map with its varied terrain to reach your target.<br><br>Join a Wolf Clan Alliance<br>Team up with like-minded players in an Alliance to expand your territory and conquer the world of wolves together. Participate in PVP battles against other packs to become the ruler of the wild.<br><br>Cross-server gameplay <br>Where players from different servers can play together and compete with each other in the same virtual environment. This adds a new level of excitement and challenge to the game as Wolf kings can interact with a wider range of opponents, forming alliances and engaging in battles on a massive scale. With cross-server feature, The Alphas have the opportunity to truly test their skills and see how they stack up against players from all over the world.<br><br>Explore the Wilderness<br>Send out scouts, explore the wild world , discover border invasions, spot traces of prey, avoid hunters&#39; tracking. So the Alpha and pack can survive the wilderness.<br><br>Build a Wolf Kingdom<br>Strategize to win battles and conquer the wild world, creating a wolf empire and becoming the Alpha of the pack.<br><br>Seamless World Map<br>All in-game actions occur on a single big map inhabited by players and NPCs, with no isolated bases or separate battle screens. The \u201cinfinite zoom\u201d on mobile allows you to go through the world map and individual bases freely. Map features include natural obstructions such as rivers, mountains, and strategic passes that must be captured to gain access to adjacent areas.<br><br><br>Attention: Wolf Game is a free-to-play strategy game themed on animals, while it offers in-app purchases for some in-game items and functions.<br><br>A network connection is required to play this game.<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/wolfgameEN<br>Youtube:https://www.youtube.com/@wolfgame__offical<br>Discord\uff1ahttps://discord.com/invite/CNq8BRcqmB",
